          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <!-- Bday celebration info -->\n    <h1>Alex turns 14!</h1>\n    <p>Please join me on July 25th to celebrate my birthday! There will be music, cake, and games. Hope to see you there!</p> \n    <img src=\"Balloons.jpg alt=\"colorful balloons\">\n    <p>Photo by pcst from FreeImages</p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
